{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"74157625-73a2-4cd","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_46a7781b494e465991244bece4a93d34|fc_03a62d21a6502e93016afecbfbcfa887d0997a4484c8e27ced","toolName":"grep","content":[{"type":"text","text":"src/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-7-    its exception and businesses never mix.\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:8: 2. ``task_views``: split each scenario into the agent, simulator and evaluator\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:9:    views. The agent never sees the caller goal, fixtures or the answer key.\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-10- 3. ``estimate_tokens``: an approximate token count (no tokenizer is bundled;\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-19- \nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:20: from voice_agent.data.loader import BusinessPack\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-21- \nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-111-     \"\"\"Split one scenario into the three views required by the dataset contract.\"\"\"\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:112:     # The agent gets nothing task-specific beyond an ID: its knowledge and tools are\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-113-     # the same for every task, and everything else arrives through the conversation.\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:114:     agent = {\"id\": task[\"id\"]}\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:115:     simulator = {\"id\": task[\"id\"], \"caller\": task[\"caller\"]}\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:116:     evaluator = {\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-117-         \"id\": task[\"id\"],\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-123-     harness = {\"id\": task[\"id\"], \"environment\": task[\"environment\"], \"tool_results\": task[\"tool_results\"]}\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py:124:     return {\"agent\": agent, \"simulator\": simulator, \"evaluator\": evaluator, \"harness\": harness}\nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-125- \nsrc/voice_agent/data/preprocess.py-127- def check_views(views: dict) -> None:\nsrc/voice_ag